== Standard-library codecs ==

== JsonCodec stays the default ==
Decimal requires an opt-in codec: No Genie codec registered for value of type 'Decimal'.

== Register stdlib codecs explicitly ==
registered: bytes, datetime, decimal, UUID, dataclass, and enum codecs

